        "end_time": 7.4,
        "speaker_id": "Speaker_1",
        "speaker_role": "patient",
        "text": "D\u1ea1 em b\u1ecb \u0111au b\u1ee5ng v\u00e0 \u0111i ngo\u00e0i l\u1ecfng kho\u1ea3ng hai ng\u00e0y nay.",
