        "speaker_id": "Speaker_0",
        "speaker_role": "doctor",
        "text": "Ph\u00e2n c\u00f3 m\u00e1u ho\u1eb7c c\u00f3 m\u00e0u \u0111en b\u1ea5t th\u01b0\u1eddng kh\u00f4ng?",
